Next week is dinner party.

1406
01:06:13.650 --> 01:06:13.830
Yep.

1407
01:06:14.450 --> 01:06:16.070
Holy crap sticks.

1408
01:06:16.770 --> 01:06:17.790
Dinner party.

1409
01:06:18.030 --> 01:06:18.750
We're here, Jenna.

1410
01:06:19.170 --> 01:06:20.670
We'll show up for it, guys.

1411
01:06:21.030 --> 01:06:22.210
I can't wait.

1412
